  "descriptionMarkdown": "Blueprint needs to be copied, off-shore pumps removed in the copy and then the blueprint can be placed. Offshore-pumps need to be built back manually.\n\nBlueprint will generate much more Ammonia than it needs, therefore it needs to be pumped out of the system in order to avoid jamming the outputs. Some amount of ammonia will be needed inside the system to work.\n\nBlueprint components can be upgraded to legendary quality with no redesign needed. Science is output on two separate belts on each side, allowing two fully stacked belts as output.\n\nQuantum Processor layer is dependent on top Lithium Plate (Furnaces) layer which is, itself, dependent on the Lithium layer.\nScience layer is dependent on bottom Lithium Plate (Furnaces) layer which is, itself, dependent on the Lithium layer.\nHot fluoroketone layer is dependent on the Solid Fuel layer.\nCold and Hot fluoroketone layers can be extended as needed.",
